# Story 9: Layout Mode (50s)
# Hook: Resize panes on the fly -- arrow keys in layout mode.
# Duration: 50s
# Source: story-09-layout-mode.tape
#
# Voiceover script with timing cues.
# Format: [START --> END] narration text
# Each entry should be spoken within its time window.
# Gaps between entries are silent (viewer watches the demo).
#
# Total segments: 8

[00:00.0 --> 00:03.0]
Resize panes on the fly -- arrow keys in layout mode.

[00:03.0 --> 00:06.0]
Start rysh with a single pane.

[00:06.0 --> 00:14.0]
Build a 3-pane layout: two splits with Ctrl+P n.

[00:14.0 --> 00:24.0]
Ctrl+L enters layout mode. Right arrow grows the current pane's width.

[00:24.0 --> 00:30.0]
Left arrow shrinks it back.

[00:30.0 --> 00:38.0]
Down arrow grows height. Up arrow shrinks it.

[00:38.0 --> 00:43.0]
Press Escape to lock in your layout.

[00:43.0 --> 00:50.0]
Ctrl+L, arrow keys, Escape. Resize any pane to fit your workflow.

